  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Agreement  2016-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the partnership agreement is to promote development outcomes of policy and resource allocation decisions of GEF and its  partner countries through enhancement of the quality and use of evaluation undertaken by GEF in the IBRD. The grant has been made for World Bank&apos;s financial year 2016, ending June 2017. Continued grants will be subject to availability of funds for technical cooperation in the coming years.</narrative>
  </description>
